member.summary:
Format string payload at the mapping-pair level ([MapFormat]/Fluent Format syntax; null = none)


The sole legitimate consumer is degradation detection (DegradationDetectorBase.ClassifyUntranslatableDeclaration reads the "Format" field for classification);
conditional emission on the emit side — no output line is generated when this value is null (F1 byte gate).

remarks.para:
Main source selection rule: for multi-source DTOs (multiple source registrations for same target type), Channel=MapFrom takes precedence;
            among multiple entries within the same channel, the first one ordered by  is selected —
            compatible with [MapFrom] single-source semantics (rule degenerates to unique resolution in single-source scenarios).

C-1 Lock-free reads — no lock (s_allLock) appears on read paths (closed scope covering all six read endpoints:
            ///
            //
            and their forwarding endpoints); during concurrent , readers observe a consistent complete historical snapshot (either pre- or post-registration state), never torn or partially written states. All three internal containers use "immutable arrays + wholesale replacement": any read endpoint accesses only a single container (read model P3), remaining oblivious to publication interleaving.
